Name: chromenet engine
Short Name: chromenet
URL: https://github.com/gosuda/chromenet
Version: N/A
Update Mechanism: Static
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
The chrome_net_server glue between the HQQ RPC runtime and //net. scripts/engine/engine.py copies
this directory to //third_party/chromenet, adds the HQQ C runtime as //third_party/chromenet/hqq,
and writes LICENSE with the chromenet and HQQ licenses.
